Hi everyone,

from the meeting today, the suggestion was to submit two abstracts to BioC2021:

- a short talk aimed at giving an overview of who we are and what we do (similar to the one from EuroBioc last year)
- a long workshop structured according to the ‘lesson development sprint’/‘joint material development session’ mentioned below (with an initial introduction of the guiding principles and the practicalities of lesson development).

We started drafting the abstracts in this google doc (also linked from the usual agenda): https://docs.google.com/document/d/1j3uz_lWYisb7JgReeQyNHqelyn2PVKvO6z-whEI5jnc/edit?usp=sharing

Contributions and suggestions are welcome - note that the deadline for submission is on Tuesday (March 16), so please make sure to provide any comments before lunchtime on Tuesday.

Charlotte

